## Scripts

Suggested package scripts (pnpm):

- `dev`: Vite dev server
- `build`: TypeScript typecheck and Vite build (`tsc -b && vite build`)
- `preview`: Vite preview
- `lint`: ESLint
- `lint:fix`: ESLint with auto-fix
- `format`: Prettier write
- `typecheck`: TypeScript type checking (`tsc -b`)
- `runtime-config:apply`: Copy `config/runtime/runtime-config.<env>.json` into `public/runtime-config.json`
- `prebuild`: Runs `runtime-config:apply` before invoking the build
- `clean`: Remove `dist`, `node_modules`, then prune the pnpm store (`rimraf dist node_modules && pnpm store prune`)
- `test`: Run unit tests (`vitest run`) - Use Docker on Windows
- `test:watch`: Run unit tests in watch mode (`vitest`)
- `test:ui`: Run Vitest UI (`vitest --ui`)
- `test:coverage`: Run unit tests with coverage (`vitest run --coverage`)
- `test:e2e`: Run e2e tests (Playwright)
- `test:e2e:ui`: Run Playwright with the inspector UI
- `docker:test`: Run unit tests with Docker (recommended on Windows)
- `docker:test:watch`: Run unit tests in watch mode with Docker
- `docker:test:e2e`: Run e2e tests with Docker
- `check:bundle-size`: Analyze bundle sizes after a build
- `sync-tokens`: Sync design tokens into Tailwind and component theme layers
- `docker:build`: Build the dev docker-compose image
- `docker:dev`: Start the dev docker-compose stack
- `docker:down`: Stop the dev docker-compose stack
- `docker:shell`: Open a shell inside the dev container
- `docker:prod:build`: Build the production image (`Dockerfile.prod`)
- `docker:prod:up`: Start the production docker-compose stack
- `docker:prod:down`: Stop the production docker-compose stack

Custom automation currently lives in:

- `scripts/check-bundle-size.js`
- `scripts/sync-design-tokens.js`
- `scripts/apply-runtime-config.mjs`

Add new generators or mock servers as fresh files (there is no `scripts/codegen.ts` or `scripts/mockServer.ts` in this repo).
